  62:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_alarm_ack.c ****  * by a call to apdu_set_confirmed_handler().
  63:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_alarm_ack.c ****  * This handler builds a response packet, which is
  64:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_alarm_ack.c ****  * - an Abort if
  65:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_alarm_ack.c ****  *   - the message is segmented
